6ac2d7bcab1a6dcdd0b38d1ffb0fd4.avif?t=1683219491\" width=616 height=117 /></span> <br>From the voluptuous Smashmounds, to the back alleys of Booty Bay, and everything in between, discover an unpredictable, interconnected world filled with monsters to recruit, hidden date spots, and outlandish baddies and boss encounters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192810/extras/14307ab95aa54d01f5f6818c9202a056.avif?t=1683219491\" width=616 height=117 /></span> <br>As the former glorious Drac, stripped of their old powers, it’s up to you to become your best bloodthirsty self. Vanquish goons with iconic weapons, elementals, bats, and even Medusa’s &quot;headouken!&quot; on the road to your victorious rampage in this side-scrolling platformer.", "short_description": "Bite into Romancelvania, a darkly comic genre mashup, combining side-scrolling action and tongue-in-cheek romance into one completely absurd and unforgettable adventure.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The characters, their backstories, the ridiculous nature of everything going on will have you coming back for more”<br>GameCrate<br><br>“Just like in the reality show, no matter your flavor of weird, Romancelvania’s got something for you”<br>CogConnected<br><br>“Worthwhile for folks who enjoy a witty story-driven romance, especially where sexy monsters are involved”<br>But Why Tho<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192810/header.jpg?t=1683219491", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192810/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1683219491", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192810/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1683219491", "website": "https://www.romancelvania.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<stron